mapping "W103.1" source="W103" target="217083007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=40 {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W103 is a Swedish national extension of W10 (Fall on and from stairs and steps) qualified
        with place SNOMED CT 217083007 (no activity dimension). Target SNOMED CT 441749 (code 217083007),
        crosswalk-verified for base W10 (45756250 Maps to 441749). Target subsumes the mechanism; place
        qualifier dropped.
        """
}
mapping "W1030.1" source="W1030" target="217083007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=60 {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W1030 = SNOMED CT 217083007 (Swedish ICD-10 extension combining the fall event, the place
        axis, and the activity axis into one code). Target SNOMED CT 441749 = (concept_code 217083007,
        standard_concept=S, Observation domain), the crosswalk destination for the parent ICD-10 W10
        (mirror relationship 45756250 → 441749). SNOMED CT does have combined fall+place concepts (40419968
        sports-area 220454003, 40419969 street 220455002, 40419970 trade 220456001, 40419971 industrial
        220457005) but all four are invalid_reason=U (non-standard) and each carries its own edge to
        441749; no SNOMED CT concept encodes the activity axis at all. 441749 is therefore the best
        available standard target: it fully subsumes the fall event but drops both the place and
        activity modifiers (two-level broader). (moderate): a verified Athena crosswalk through the W10
        parent, but the equivalence is loose because the standard target carries no place or activity
        information.
        """
}
mapping "W1031.1" source="W1031" target="217083007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W1031 = SNOMED CT 217083007. Target SNOMED CT 441749 = (217083007, standard). Activity and
        place axes have no SNOMED CT representation; 441749 is the crosswalk destination of the W10 parent.
        Two-level broader (event kept, place+activity dropped).
        """
}
